WEBVTT

01:25.360 --> 01:29.950
[Coroner's Diary]

01:30.650 --> 01:33.930
[Episode 35]

01:35.360 --> 01:36.930
What Ms. Qin has said

01:36.930 --> 01:40.000
matches your investigation results
completely.

01:40.490 --> 01:41.039
Yes.

01:46.330 --> 01:48.800
Why isn't Wan speaking?

01:50.130 --> 01:51.090
Your Majesty,

01:51.460 --> 01:53.460
Princess Zhaoyu is my elder sister.

01:53.520 --> 01:55.050
I should avoid speaking on the matter.

01:55.050 --> 01:57.080
Besides, she has caused such a disaster,

01:57.080 --> 01:59.140
I am too ashamed to face Your Majesty.

02:03.240 --> 02:04.570
If Your Majesty wishes to punish someone,

02:04.570 --> 02:06.030
please punish me instead.

02:06.130 --> 02:07.550
Why would I punish you?

02:07.880 --> 02:10.080
You have nothing to do with this matter.

02:10.080 --> 02:10.960
Get up, get up.

02:11.730 --> 02:13.130
Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:19.210 --> 02:21.050
The Prince Yan Che's escape

02:21.890 --> 02:23.550
has nothing to do with Ms. Qin.

02:24.120 --> 02:25.520
As for the fire incident,

02:25.770 --> 02:26.520
I...

02:26.710 --> 02:28.770
cannot bear to blame her any further.

02:28.930 --> 02:30.240
However,

02:30.640 --> 02:33.450
it would be inappropriate for Ms. Qin

02:33.450 --> 02:34.960
to remain in the restricted quarters.

02:34.960 --> 02:37.210
Considering she was newly married

02:37.400 --> 02:40.530
when she became implicated
in Prince Yan Che's affairs.

02:40.960 --> 02:42.160
Here's what we'll do.

02:42.329 --> 02:43.079
I

02:43.240 --> 02:44.360
graciously permit her to return

02:44.360 --> 02:46.450
to the Marquis of Zhongyong's Mansion,

02:46.450 --> 02:48.250
to rest and recover peacefully.

02:48.290 --> 02:50.350
She must not leave without my decree.

02:50.400 --> 02:53.000
And a royal physician
will attend to her daily.

02:54.610 --> 02:55.470
Wan.

02:56.450 --> 02:58.390
I show her such mercy

02:58.890 --> 03:00.680
partly because you and she

03:00.680 --> 03:02.450
come from the same family.

03:02.640 --> 03:03.840
However, this matter

03:03.890 --> 03:05.360
should not be publicized

03:05.360 --> 03:06.280
to avoid

03:06.400 --> 03:07.800
further complications.

03:08.840 --> 03:09.360
Yes.

03:12.050 --> 03:13.170
Thank you for Your Majesty's benevolence.

03:13.170 --> 03:15.210
Thank you for Your Majesty's benevolence.

03:15.210 --> 03:16.410
Recently,

03:16.640 --> 03:18.480
the Empress Dowager has been unwell.

03:18.480 --> 03:20.270
When you have time,
come to the palace more often

03:20.270 --> 03:21.870
to keep Her Majesty company.

03:22.800 --> 03:23.329
Yes.

03:26.890 --> 03:27.770
You may go now.

03:44.120 --> 03:45.510
Your Highness, please wait a moment.

03:45.510 --> 03:47.510
I'll go inform them of your arrival.

03:53.560 --> 03:55.420
Why were you distracted earlier?

03:59.880 --> 04:01.320
I just find it strange

04:01.770 --> 04:04.400
that His Majesty acts so coldly
towards Yan Che.

04:04.400 --> 04:06.150
He is his only legitimate son.

04:07.120 --> 04:09.240
Even if he despises his lack of ambition,

04:09.240 --> 04:12.010
he shouldn't be so indifferent
to his whereabouts.

04:12.010 --> 04:14.340
His Majesty could let Zhaoyu return home,

04:14.840 --> 04:16.730
yet why does he show no affection

04:16.730 --> 04:18.290
toward his only legitimate son?

04:18.290 --> 04:21.290
His Majesty isn't necessarily
showing affection to Qin Zhaoyu,

04:21.290 --> 04:22.170
but rather bestowing favour on

04:22.170 --> 04:24.770
those officials
who once served Prince Yan Che

04:24.880 --> 04:26.050
to win their loyalty

04:26.050 --> 04:27.240
and stabilise the court.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.950
If he truly wanted stability,

04:29.170 --> 04:31.930
he wouldn't make a bastard like Yan Qi
the crown prince.

04:31.930 --> 04:34.159
His Majesty might not actually think this,

04:34.159 --> 04:36.210
after all, there's still Sui.

04:36.550 --> 04:38.950
But His Majesty is cold towards Sui
as well.

04:40.120 --> 04:41.380
This is truly strange.

04:41.600 --> 04:43.230
His Majesty is distant and cold

04:43.230 --> 04:44.360
toward his own sons,

04:44.850 --> 04:46.490
yet only in front of Yan Li,

04:46.730 --> 04:48.530
does he act like a loving father.

04:51.240 --> 04:52.770
According to Grandmother,

04:53.170 --> 04:55.170
this change happened
after Consort Jin's tragedy.

04:55.170 --> 04:56.040
Before that,

04:56.240 --> 04:57.540
His Majesty was quite fond

04:57.540 --> 04:58.860
of Sui as well.

04:59.240 --> 05:00.760
Could Consort Jin's death

05:00.760 --> 05:02.360
have changed his temperament
so drastically?

05:02.360 --> 05:04.010
I rarely returned to the capital before.

05:04.010 --> 05:05.140
If you have such questions,

05:05.140 --> 05:07.120
you could ask Grandmother about them.

05:07.120 --> 05:07.950
However,

05:08.410 --> 05:09.210
it is true that

05:09.490 --> 05:11.150
after Prince Jin's incident,

05:11.210 --> 05:14.200
His Majesty became increasingly suspicious
of Father.

05:14.200 --> 05:15.800
It seems Consort Jin's death

05:16.020 --> 05:18.080
is more complicated than we thought.

05:20.440 --> 05:21.770
After we capture Yan Qi,

05:22.190 --> 05:24.390
I'll investigate this matter with you.

05:24.610 --> 05:25.810
For now, we don't know

05:25.850 --> 05:28.000
how far this conspiracy extends.

05:28.290 --> 05:29.820
While you're in the palace,

05:30.010 --> 05:31.270
be extremely careful.

05:31.650 --> 05:32.180
Alright.

05:36.650 --> 05:39.110
Grandmother's pulse is stable and healthy,

05:39.240 --> 05:40.900
she's just not sleeping well,

05:41.290 --> 05:43.620
which is why she feels somewhat fatigued.

05:43.880 --> 05:46.680
Since I entered the palace as a consort
in my teens,

05:47.680 --> 05:49.290
and the palace intrigues

05:49.290 --> 05:51.409
have never ceased.

05:52.760 --> 05:54.560
It's just a fire,

05:55.170 --> 05:56.650
it won't frighten me.

05:57.730 --> 05:58.560
Grandmother.

05:59.320 --> 06:01.050
If you could follow your heart

06:01.050 --> 06:02.510
and make the choice again,

06:02.800 --> 06:05.360
would you still be willing
to enter the palace as a consort?

06:05.360 --> 06:07.160
Everyone living in this world

06:07.190 --> 06:08.630
has their own troubles.

06:09.730 --> 06:11.440
In my entire life,

06:12.320 --> 06:13.930
there were only two times

06:13.930 --> 06:16.490
when I followed my own heart,

06:16.490 --> 06:17.420
and to this day

06:17.880 --> 06:20.410
I still don't know
if they were right or wrong.

06:21.090 --> 06:23.050
But since they were my own decisions,

06:23.050 --> 06:24.170
I have no regrets.

06:24.650 --> 06:26.970
Even when we make our own decisions,

06:28.050 --> 06:29.530
the outcome may not be

06:29.530 --> 06:31.170
what we truly wanted.

06:32.200 --> 06:34.490
That, as well, is the irony of fate.

06:34.880 --> 06:36.560
Take Zhaoyu for example,

06:36.560 --> 06:38.290
if not for His Majesty's mercy,

06:38.360 --> 06:39.960
she would likely be spending

06:40.409 --> 06:43.340
the rest of her life alone
in the forbidden quarters.

06:46.560 --> 06:47.360
Wan.

06:48.760 --> 06:50.220
Let me tell you something.

06:50.320 --> 06:53.120
Don't get too involved in palace affairs.

06:53.530 --> 06:54.680
You and Chi

06:54.680 --> 06:57.120
should live your own life
behind closed doors.

06:57.120 --> 06:58.200
Your Father has

06:58.200 --> 07:00.320
only Chi as his flesh and blood.

07:00.850 --> 07:03.240
Stay as far away from trouble as possible.

07:04.880 --> 07:06.290
I will keep that in mind.

07:07.730 --> 07:09.170
Sui is playing outside.

07:09.720 --> 07:10.940
Go find him.

07:11.610 --> 07:14.000
He's been looking forward to your visit
every day.

07:14.000 --> 07:14.650
Yes.

07:35.380 --> 07:36.940
Any news of Che?

07:36.960 --> 07:38.470
Will His Majesty...

07:39.020 --> 07:41.440
A young eunuch saw Prince Yan Che
leaving the palace,

07:41.440 --> 07:42.360
accompanied by

07:42.360 --> 07:44.360
what appeared to be Lord Zhao's men.

07:44.850 --> 07:46.050
His Majesty promised you

07:46.050 --> 07:47.850
he wouldn't harm Prince Yan Che,

07:48.010 --> 07:49.810
so please don't worry yourself.

07:49.880 --> 07:52.409
Since the fire last night,

07:52.800 --> 07:54.610
he hasn't come to see me once.

07:55.409 --> 07:56.610
He resents me

07:57.060 --> 07:59.390
for pleading on Che's behalf, doesn't he?

07:59.970 --> 08:01.660
If I had known he would be

08:02.120 --> 08:03.850
so cold-hearted,

08:04.530 --> 08:05.240
I...

08:05.260 --> 08:06.210
Empress Dowager,

08:06.210 --> 08:08.540
His Majesty has reached the age of wisdom.

08:08.680 --> 08:10.530
Managing such a vast court,

08:10.530 --> 08:12.240
how could he still be like before,

08:12.240 --> 08:14.440
coming to pay respects to you every day?

08:14.970 --> 08:16.800
-If my Huai...
-Your Majesty.

08:19.690 --> 08:20.320
Alright.

08:21.510 --> 08:22.710
Let's not speak of it.

08:23.100 --> 08:23.870
Let's not.

08:31.900 --> 08:34.080
[Marquis of Zhongyong's Mansion]

08:33.179 --> 08:34.020
Father.

08:35.010 --> 08:37.409
His Majesty has actually allowed Yu
to return home to recover.

08:37.409 --> 08:38.970
What could be his intention?

08:38.970 --> 08:39.730
Silence!

08:40.010 --> 08:42.650
Yan, is Yu coming home?

08:44.250 --> 08:45.460
Go and tidy up

08:45.490 --> 08:46.760
Yu's quarters.

08:46.780 --> 08:48.700
Your Grace, when Yu returns,

08:49.320 --> 08:51.230
will she still be the Crown Princess?

08:51.230 --> 08:53.630
The deposed Crown Prince has already fled,

08:53.720 --> 08:55.920
how can there still be a Crown Princess.

08:56.050 --> 08:57.890
My poor daughter!

08:58.410 --> 08:59.010
Quickly,

08:59.060 --> 09:00.340
bring Madam back to her room.

09:00.340 --> 09:00.980
Yes.

09:01.820 --> 09:03.850
Madam, let's go.

09:06.970 --> 09:08.360
You're not so young anymore,

09:08.360 --> 09:09.430
why do you still

09:09.480 --> 09:11.210
lose your composure so easily?

09:11.310 --> 09:13.110
I was just worried and confused.

09:13.790 --> 09:14.910
But Father,

09:15.370 --> 09:16.410
the honour of
the Marquis of Zhongyong's Mansion

09:16.410 --> 09:17.840
depends entirely on the Eastern Palace.

09:17.840 --> 09:18.590
Nonsense!

09:19.640 --> 09:21.260
The lives of everyone in our household

09:21.260 --> 09:22.790
are in His Majesty's hands.

09:23.840 --> 09:26.180
His Majesty allowing Yu to return

09:26.320 --> 09:27.840
is a warning to us

09:27.840 --> 09:29.770
not to get involved in this matter.

09:29.800 --> 09:30.930
If we harbour any disloyalty again,

09:30.930 --> 09:33.390
His Majesty will execute
our entire family.

09:33.470 --> 09:36.130
Father, are you really willing
to just sit and wait for death?

09:36.130 --> 09:37.170
Everyone in court knows

09:37.170 --> 09:38.960
you're the leader
of Crown Prince's faction,

09:38.960 --> 09:41.620
and that His Majesty
will never trust you again.

09:43.720 --> 09:44.800
Father,

09:46.680 --> 09:47.960
are you just going to watch

09:47.960 --> 09:48.840
as our titles

09:48.840 --> 09:51.240
and everything we've worked for slip away?

09:51.450 --> 09:52.790
While there's still time,

09:52.790 --> 09:54.340
let's immediately send a message
to the Northern Army

09:54.340 --> 09:55.940
and help His Highness rebel.

09:56.840 --> 09:57.700
What a traitor!

09:58.850 --> 10:00.180
The Qin family's titles

10:00.410 --> 10:02.010
were all earned through
loyalty and bravery.

10:02.010 --> 10:02.840
Without loyalty,

10:02.840 --> 10:05.440
how could we still stand
in the imperial court?

10:11.260 --> 10:13.390
No matter how valuable the titles are,

10:14.480 --> 10:15.720
they're not worth

10:16.450 --> 10:18.650
the lives of everyone in our household.

10:35.320 --> 10:36.080
Sui.

10:37.480 --> 10:38.410
Wan.

10:38.800 --> 10:39.650
What's wrong?

10:39.650 --> 10:40.580
Are you unhappy?

10:41.720 --> 10:42.880
I miss Mother.

10:45.010 --> 10:45.560
Come.

10:48.650 --> 10:49.480
Sui,

10:49.890 --> 10:52.080
my mom and dad

10:52.080 --> 10:53.340
have also passed away.

10:54.250 --> 10:55.690
When I miss them,

10:55.890 --> 10:57.750
I talk to the stars in the sky,

10:58.290 --> 11:00.090
and it makes me feel much better.

11:00.440 --> 11:02.770
Do you believe they've gone to heaven?

11:03.480 --> 11:04.680
I do believe so.

11:05.930 --> 11:08.840
I don't know
if there are immortals in heaven,

11:08.840 --> 11:10.480
and my mom used to
scold me and my dad

11:10.480 --> 11:11.440
quite fiercely,

11:11.840 --> 11:13.320
but I know

11:13.320 --> 11:16.130
they were the people who loved me most
in this world.

11:16.130 --> 11:17.730
No matter where they are now,

11:18.130 --> 11:20.200
they would want me to be just like before,

11:20.200 --> 11:21.410
safe and happy.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.450
But I don't have a dad.

11:26.130 --> 11:27.250
I only have Father.

11:36.320 --> 11:37.130
What's that?

11:39.480 --> 11:41.050
Bring us some snacks.

11:42.130 --> 11:42.840
Yes.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.800
Wan, do you trust me?

12:05.480 --> 12:06.320
I trust you.

12:06.630 --> 12:07.830
Then, let me tell you.

12:07.930 --> 12:10.080
I was pretending

12:10.080 --> 12:11.280
to not be able to speak

12:11.510 --> 12:12.360
nor write.

12:13.950 --> 12:15.420
What happened?

12:15.480 --> 12:17.010
Why did you have to pretend?

12:18.410 --> 12:19.900
Because I saw

12:20.480 --> 12:22.130
Father killing Mother.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.240
It was Father,

12:24.260 --> 12:25.540
not Prince Jin.

12:25.570 --> 12:26.980
I saw it with my own eyes.

12:27.370 --> 12:29.200
You were afraid
His Majesty would find out,

12:29.200 --> 12:31.330
so you pretended to be simple-minded?

12:31.560 --> 12:34.440
Father used to treat me as well as
he treats Li.

12:34.970 --> 12:36.210
But since that day,

12:36.560 --> 12:38.230
when Father looks at me,

12:38.410 --> 12:40.270
his eyes are always dark and cold.

12:40.590 --> 12:42.960
Father's temper has gotten worse,

12:42.980 --> 12:45.110
if he finds out, he will surely kill me.

12:45.250 --> 12:46.930
Wan, please believe me.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.170
I believe you.

12:49.480 --> 12:50.500
Don't worry, Sui,

12:50.760 --> 12:52.420
Chi and I will protect you.

12:52.600 --> 12:55.530
Grandmother says you're the best coroner
in Zhou,

12:55.530 --> 12:56.990
I've told you everything,

12:57.010 --> 12:59.170
can you and Chi help me?

12:59.190 --> 13:00.730
I don't want Mother and Prince Jin

13:00.730 --> 13:02.370
to have died in vain.

13:03.970 --> 13:05.160
I promise you.

13:07.410 --> 13:08.440
That day,

13:08.870 --> 13:10.260
I was supposed to join my brothers

13:10.260 --> 13:12.840
at the book appreciation banquet
in the rear garden.

13:12.840 --> 13:14.630
Prince Jin promised me

13:14.680 --> 13:16.450
that he would give me a gift,

13:16.820 --> 13:19.170
but I don't like those adult banquets,

13:19.650 --> 13:21.700
so I pretended to be sick and didn't go.

13:21.700 --> 13:26.030
Instead, I sneaked into Hanguang Hall
to look through Mother's collections.

13:26.330 --> 13:27.640
To my surprise,

13:27.720 --> 13:30.250
Father and Mother returned early,

13:30.890 --> 13:32.950
so I quickly hid behind the curtains.

13:33.040 --> 13:33.880
I ask you,

13:33.900 --> 13:35.940
where did you get this book?

13:35.970 --> 13:37.070
What are you plotting?

13:37.070 --> 13:39.510
Your Majesty might as well tell me,

13:37.720 --> 13:39.530
[Consort Jin]

13:39.540 --> 13:41.870
why is Your Majesty's handwriting

13:42.050 --> 13:45.680
completely different from
that in the book?

13:45.680 --> 13:47.170
Haven't I told you before?

13:47.390 --> 13:48.820
I was once injured.

13:48.850 --> 13:51.330
I hurt my waist, back, and arms,

13:51.380 --> 13:53.780
so naturally my handwriting changed.

13:54.490 --> 13:56.940
I had never seen Father so angry.

13:56.960 --> 13:58.820
I was so scared, I covered my ears.

14:14.130 --> 14:14.930
Sui.

14:15.570 --> 14:16.850
Prince Jin is here.

14:29.110 --> 14:30.950
[Prince Jin]

14:30.610 --> 14:32.810
Quickly, call the imperial physician.

14:40.530 --> 14:41.820
You know nothing,

14:41.850 --> 14:43.210
don't tell anyone,

14:43.650 --> 14:44.780
don't say anything.

14:58.200 --> 14:59.060
Your Highness.

15:03.990 --> 15:05.240
It's all my fault.

15:05.450 --> 15:07.520
If I had dared to rush out then,

15:07.540 --> 15:09.110
Mother wouldn't have died.

15:09.560 --> 15:12.290
If I hadn't forgotten my promise
with Prince Jin,

15:12.480 --> 15:14.880
he wouldn't have suffered this injustice.

15:15.530 --> 15:16.790
Don't think like that.

15:17.480 --> 15:18.320
Sui,

15:18.650 --> 15:19.510
remember this,

15:19.630 --> 15:21.730
your mother's death
has nothing to do with you,

15:21.730 --> 15:24.180
and Prince Jin's suffering
isn't because of you either.

15:24.180 --> 15:25.260
I promise you,

15:25.680 --> 15:26.930
Chi and I

15:27.050 --> 15:27.800
will definitely find out

15:27.800 --> 15:29.800
why His Majesty killed your mother.

15:29.840 --> 15:31.200
Thank you, Wan.

15:32.770 --> 15:33.530
Good child.

15:39.250 --> 15:40.170
Steward Duoshou,

15:39.990 --> 15:42.390
[Xuanji Pavilion]

15:40.550 --> 15:42.350
airing out chess manuals again?

15:43.250 --> 15:45.130
Welcome Prince Rui

15:45.130 --> 15:46.320
Princess Consort Rui,

15:46.320 --> 15:47.840
and Prince Yan Sui.

15:48.110 --> 15:49.580
As Prince Rui said,

15:49.720 --> 15:52.140
I can only do
these minor tasks now.

15:52.250 --> 15:54.790
May I ask what calligraphy samples
Prince Rui is looking for?

15:54.790 --> 15:56.030
I'll just...

15:56.080 --> 15:56.580
No need,

15:56.870 --> 15:57.870
give me the key,

15:57.900 --> 15:59.020
I'll go myself.

15:59.040 --> 16:01.160
Then I'll trouble Prince Rui.

16:01.680 --> 16:02.860
With those old bones of yours,

16:02.860 --> 16:04.060
you should rest well.

16:05.340 --> 16:07.540
Thank you for your concern, Prince Rui.

16:15.070 --> 16:17.530
These chess manuals are just
some beginner's guides,

16:17.530 --> 16:19.350
why does you need to
manage them personally?

16:19.350 --> 16:21.080
Princess Consort Rui may not know,

16:21.080 --> 16:22.130
these few chess manuals,

16:22.130 --> 16:24.170
though not works of masters,

16:24.170 --> 16:26.570
are His Majesty's treasured possessions.

16:26.930 --> 16:28.130
Why would His Majesty

16:28.130 --> 16:29.600
like these books meant for children?

16:29.600 --> 16:33.320
His Majesty is a genius at chess,

16:33.320 --> 16:35.800
often saying that the essence of chess

16:35.800 --> 16:37.960
lies in the simplest principles,

16:37.960 --> 16:39.720
and that all variations
come from the same origin.

16:39.720 --> 16:41.320
These beginner's books

16:41.320 --> 16:44.650
have helped His Majesty
become nearly unbeatable.

16:45.250 --> 16:46.440
Could it be that His Majesty

16:46.440 --> 16:49.800
deliberately loses to the Empress Dowager
and Grand Princess?

16:49.800 --> 16:52.600
It must be due to
His Majesty's filial piety.

16:52.970 --> 16:55.450
Unfortunately, His Majesty
is now busy with state affairs,

16:55.450 --> 16:57.230
and has no time to study chess manuals,

16:57.230 --> 17:00.010
nor express himself
through calligraphy anymore.

17:00.010 --> 17:01.990
Since I have been assigned here,

17:02.320 --> 17:03.490
the Xuanji Pavilion

17:03.680 --> 17:05.730
has not been collecting

17:05.849 --> 17:08.000
any of His Majesty's calligraphy works.

17:08.000 --> 17:09.130
Thank you, Steward.

17:09.880 --> 17:10.490
Please.

17:15.609 --> 17:16.420
Chi.

17:17.680 --> 17:18.480
What is it?

17:20.369 --> 17:21.970
Help me get the one at the top.

17:22.720 --> 17:23.780
The scroll up there.

17:23.780 --> 17:24.540
Which one?

17:24.609 --> 17:25.810
The one in the corner.

17:25.960 --> 17:26.650
This one?

17:31.810 --> 17:34.040
It seems His Majesty
indeed hasn't visited for a long time.

17:34.040 --> 17:37.300
Otherwise, the servants wouldn't dare
to be so negligent.

17:43.370 --> 17:44.610
This was the scroll I saw Mother hiding

17:44.610 --> 17:46.570
the last time I accompanied her

17:47.330 --> 17:48.850
to the Xuanji Pavilion.

17:49.280 --> 17:50.090
Sui,

17:50.530 --> 17:51.990
do you know who wrote this?

17:52.200 --> 17:53.290
Mother said

17:53.370 --> 17:56.230
this is Father's calligraphy
from before he ascended the throne,

17:56.230 --> 17:58.630
which she had found with great difficulty.

18:01.760 --> 18:04.090
These two handwritings
are indeed identical.

18:04.090 --> 18:05.190
The seal on this,

18:05.410 --> 18:07.590
although is His Majesty's personal seal,

18:07.590 --> 18:10.480
differs greatly from the handwriting
in His Majesty's vermilion rescript.

18:10.480 --> 18:12.040
The handwriting on His Majesty's rescripts

18:12.040 --> 18:13.300
is vigorous and sharp,

18:13.330 --> 18:14.660
powerful and forceful,

18:14.810 --> 18:16.940
with none of this harmonious quality.

18:17.090 --> 18:17.890
Chi,

18:19.840 --> 18:21.660
this is what I found
in Mother's calligraphy notes

18:21.660 --> 18:23.880
on the day she died.

18:25.350 --> 18:26.420
Seems like

18:26.440 --> 18:29.500
it was also written
before Father ascended the throne.

18:36.320 --> 18:38.050
The handwriting is identical.

18:40.170 --> 18:40.960
Sui,

18:41.410 --> 18:43.340
does His Majesty know you have this note?

18:43.340 --> 18:44.130
No, he doesn't.

18:44.130 --> 18:45.480
I've never told anyone.

18:46.450 --> 18:47.170
Sui,

18:47.240 --> 18:48.680
go play over there for a while,

18:48.680 --> 18:50.170
I need to speak with Chi.

18:59.600 --> 19:00.960
Those pages and scrolls

19:00.960 --> 19:02.470
that led to Consort Jin's death

19:02.470 --> 19:04.670
must have been disposed by His Majesty.

19:04.720 --> 19:05.850
I still need to carefully compare

19:05.850 --> 19:07.960
His Majesty's calligraphy
from before his ascension,

19:07.960 --> 19:08.930
to better deduce

19:08.930 --> 19:11.790
the true reason why His Majesty
killed Consort Jin.

19:12.930 --> 19:14.300
If what Sui said is true,

19:15.330 --> 19:16.610
then we can confirm

19:17.130 --> 19:18.090
that Prince Jin was framed

19:18.090 --> 19:19.690
for trying to cover up

19:19.890 --> 19:21.950
His Majesty's murder of Consort Jin.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.400
Throughout history,

19:24.810 --> 19:27.890
whenever rulers disregard the law
and kill indiscriminately,

19:27.890 --> 19:29.950
it inevitably leads to public unrest

19:30.170 --> 19:31.280
and gives the disloyal

19:31.280 --> 19:33.280
a justification to fight for the throne.

19:33.280 --> 19:34.130
Therefore,

19:34.130 --> 19:35.330
throughout the ages,

19:35.370 --> 19:38.040
such actions have been seen
as omens of a dynasty's downfall.

19:38.040 --> 19:40.170
But His Majesty prides himself on
being an enlightened ruler

19:40.170 --> 19:42.440
and has always encouraged open criticism.

19:42.440 --> 19:45.170
If news of him killing Consort Jin
were to spread,

19:45.480 --> 19:47.040
it would likely cause court officials

19:47.040 --> 19:49.410
to impeach His Majesty
for breaking laws and moral codes,

19:49.410 --> 19:51.440
leading to turmoil throughout the court.

19:51.440 --> 19:52.210
Therefore,

19:52.650 --> 19:53.760
His Majesty would certainly

19:53.760 --> 19:54.960
try to conceal it by all means.

19:54.960 --> 19:57.680
Prince Jin only knew
that His Majesty killed Consort Jin,

19:57.680 --> 19:59.140
not the reasons behind it.

19:59.930 --> 20:02.410
My father and he never revealed a word
about it,

20:02.410 --> 20:04.170
surely fearing it would cause chaos
in the palace

20:04.170 --> 20:05.900
and even disaster in the court.

20:06.040 --> 20:07.810
Whoever moved Song Xiwen's carcass

20:07.810 --> 20:09.270
to Prince Jin's residence

20:09.850 --> 20:11.400
must know the truth

20:12.000 --> 20:14.090
and intends to make it public.

20:15.330 --> 20:16.890
I fear it's all for the throne.

20:16.890 --> 20:19.020
Then, the Empress must know the truth.

20:19.370 --> 20:20.570
To secure the throne,

20:21.000 --> 20:22.480
she silenced Song Xiwen

20:22.880 --> 20:24.850
to eliminate future troubles
for His Majesty.

20:24.850 --> 20:26.140
No wonder Yan Che

20:26.280 --> 20:29.130
was titled Crown Prince by His Majesty
after this incident.

20:29.130 --> 20:30.200
The Empress and His Majesty

20:30.200 --> 20:32.060
had already reached a concensus.

20:32.810 --> 20:34.340
Everything the Empress did

20:34.650 --> 20:35.960
was likely to ensure Yan Che

20:35.960 --> 20:37.850
could smoothly inherit the throne.

20:37.850 --> 20:39.050
But she did not expect

20:39.280 --> 20:41.200
that His Majesty hates being manipulated
the most.

20:41.200 --> 20:43.040
Eventually, His Majesty
found an opportunity

20:43.040 --> 20:45.240
to remove both her and her son's titles.

20:46.130 --> 20:47.460
How pitiful and tragic.

20:47.850 --> 20:49.160
After Yan Che escaped,

20:49.520 --> 20:51.450
what if he tries to make a comeback?

20:51.850 --> 20:53.580
If our suspicions are correct,

20:53.810 --> 20:54.890
then Yan Che

20:55.040 --> 20:57.720
was deliberately allowed to escape
by His Majesty.

20:57.720 --> 20:59.960
I just hope he doesn't fall into
Prince Cheng's hands,

20:59.960 --> 21:01.560
or his life will be in danger.

21:04.570 --> 21:05.680
What about Sui?

21:22.040 --> 21:23.190
Don't worry, Chi,

21:23.280 --> 21:24.610
I didn't hear anything.

21:24.940 --> 21:25.940
Just like before,

21:26.540 --> 21:27.870
don't say a single word.

21:28.300 --> 21:29.590
Keep playing dumb.

22:03.330 --> 22:05.240
Ambush! Protect His Highness!

23:10.480 --> 23:12.340
I am Yan Che, Crown Prince of Zhou.

23:13.130 --> 23:14.810
How dare you!

23:14.810 --> 23:16.280
Crown Prince of Zhou?

23:17.440 --> 23:18.890
Do you deserve that title?

23:18.890 --> 23:19.810
Yan Qi,

23:20.520 --> 23:21.880
what are you trying to do?

23:21.880 --> 23:22.680
Brother,

23:23.650 --> 23:25.440
this is Mount Beimang,

23:25.930 --> 23:26.930
where all members of our Yan royal family

23:26.930 --> 23:28.930
come to their final rest.

23:29.810 --> 23:31.340
Prince Rui met his end here,

23:31.810 --> 23:32.760
and you

23:33.600 --> 23:34.490
will too.

23:35.520 --> 23:37.960
Uncle died by your hand?

23:39.200 --> 23:41.720
And now, you want to
kill your elder brother?

23:42.800 --> 23:45.460
This place has beautiful mountains
and waters.

23:45.920 --> 23:47.290
This precious spot

23:47.650 --> 23:49.110
is indeed perfect for you.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.990
Am I not being kind enough

23:51.520 --> 23:52.680
as your younger brother?

23:52.680 --> 23:53.570
Shameless!

23:54.040 --> 23:55.930
You think killing Uncle and I

23:56.090 --> 23:58.440
will secure you the Crown Prince position?

23:58.440 --> 23:59.280
Delusional!

24:00.040 --> 24:00.810
Yan Qi!

24:00.810 --> 24:01.680
So talkative.

24:01.680 --> 24:03.170
You've betrayed all morality,

24:03.170 --> 24:04.830
how could Father possibly...

25:21.520 --> 25:23.320
The deposed Crown Prince Yan Che

25:24.240 --> 25:25.570
fled the palace

25:26.370 --> 25:29.770
and secretly contacted the Northern Army
to plot rebellion.

25:29.890 --> 25:31.170
Upon being captured,

25:32.040 --> 25:34.170
knowing he couldn't face the Emperor,

25:36.520 --> 25:37.330
he

25:39.040 --> 25:40.170
took his own life

25:42.520 --> 25:43.550
by slitting his own throat.

25:43.550 --> 25:48.900
All hail Prince Cheng!

25:48.920 --> 25:50.400
So what

25:52.160 --> 25:54.200
if you're the legitimate son?

25:54.230 --> 26:01.630
All hail Prince Cheng!
All hail Prince Cheng!

26:27.610 --> 26:28.610
Empress Dowager!

26:29.170 --> 26:29.960
His Highness

26:30.440 --> 26:31.370
has passed away.

27:08.940 --> 27:11.300
My son!

27:11.590 --> 27:14.820
I am to blame for Che's death.

27:15.110 --> 27:19.050
I shouldn't have been so harsh on him,

27:19.440 --> 27:22.950
nor should I have let him flee the palace.

27:24.000 --> 27:28.400
I only wanted him to live freely.

27:31.610 --> 27:37.810
Now I have to bury my own child.

27:42.610 --> 27:43.960
Your Majesty, please restrain your grief.

27:43.960 --> 27:45.360
Take care of your health.

27:45.680 --> 27:46.480
Che

27:46.700 --> 27:48.700
would be troubled in the afterlife.

27:48.770 --> 27:50.210
My son...

27:50.650 --> 27:53.550
My dear son!

28:03.570 --> 28:04.370
Father.

28:05.630 --> 28:07.890
Father, please don't blame yourself
too much.

28:07.890 --> 28:09.290
It was all my negligence.

28:09.780 --> 28:12.520
I failed to stop Che
from taking such a desperate path.

28:12.520 --> 28:14.540
I am willing to bear all responsibility,

28:14.540 --> 28:17.270
I only ask that
you take care of yourself, Father.

28:18.280 --> 28:20.410
How is this your concern?

28:21.170 --> 28:22.460
If Che

28:22.610 --> 28:25.720
had already decided to end his life,

28:26.080 --> 28:28.650
what could you have done?

28:28.810 --> 28:29.520
Rise.

28:30.160 --> 28:31.730
My son...

28:31.760 --> 28:32.820
Thank you, Father.

28:36.740 --> 28:38.660
My child...

28:38.730 --> 28:40.410
Then I shall take my leave first

28:40.410 --> 28:41.870
and not disturb your rest.

28:47.610 --> 28:48.440
My son...

28:48.440 --> 28:49.840
Prince Rui, please wait.

28:50.090 --> 28:51.620
I have something to report.

28:52.130 --> 28:53.720
That hairpin is truly beautiful.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.810
I've found it.

28:58.960 --> 29:00.960
It was always meant as a gift for you.

29:03.000 --> 29:03.810
Chi.

29:10.280 --> 29:11.090
Chi.

29:12.520 --> 29:14.000
Tell me the truth.

29:14.250 --> 29:15.490
Do you believe

29:16.040 --> 29:17.240
that Che...

29:18.480 --> 29:20.130
Took his own life?

29:21.050 --> 29:22.410
If Your Majesty doesn't believe it,

29:22.410 --> 29:24.170
then neither do I.

29:27.370 --> 29:28.970
Of course I don't believe it.

29:29.130 --> 29:31.410
Che was gentle by nature.

29:31.930 --> 29:33.660
If he wasn't forced by someone,

29:34.240 --> 29:36.570
how could he take his own life?

29:37.680 --> 29:38.280
I

29:39.760 --> 29:40.870
command you

29:41.410 --> 29:42.900
and Wan

29:43.170 --> 29:46.090
quickly investigate
the cause of Che's death.

29:47.130 --> 29:51.570
You must uncover the whole truth for me

29:51.570 --> 29:52.570
and clear

29:53.150 --> 29:55.590
my son's name.

29:58.960 --> 30:00.690
I obey Your Majesty's command.

30:14.570 --> 30:17.300
My son...

30:25.130 --> 30:26.000
Madam.

30:26.000 --> 30:27.720
We should return to our quarters.

30:27.720 --> 30:30.320
Her Highness never allowed us
into the garden.

30:31.850 --> 30:32.850
Act smart.

30:33.240 --> 30:35.280
A neglected Princess Consort like her

30:35.280 --> 30:36.280
has no right to control me.

30:36.280 --> 30:38.210
You little tramp, what did you say?

30:38.570 --> 30:39.250
Guards!

30:39.480 --> 30:41.200
Throw this tramp into the water!

30:41.200 --> 30:42.000
Do you dare to?

30:43.060 --> 30:44.610
-Let go of me!
-Why wouldn’t I dare?

30:44.610 --> 30:45.470
Remember this.

30:46.370 --> 30:48.040
No matter how neglected I am,

30:48.440 --> 30:51.140
I am still Princess Consort Cheng's wife
appointed by His Majesty.

30:51.140 --> 30:51.900
You...

30:52.410 --> 30:54.320
You're nothing but a lowly woman

30:54.520 --> 30:56.570
who serves with her body.

30:56.570 --> 30:57.170
Do it!

30:58.260 --> 30:59.370
Let me go!

31:05.810 --> 31:07.410
She is indeed a tramp.

31:07.910 --> 31:09.190
But in my eyes,

31:10.650 --> 31:12.180
you're even worse than her.

31:14.280 --> 31:15.130
Prince.

31:15.610 --> 31:16.930
You actually hit me because of her.

31:16.930 --> 31:17.720
Feng Chenbi,

31:18.050 --> 31:19.610
I can spare your life,

31:20.040 --> 31:21.300
but I'm divorcing you.

31:22.090 --> 31:23.620
Go back and tell your father

31:23.720 --> 31:24.810
that from today on,

31:25.480 --> 31:26.960
your family should abandon

31:26.960 --> 31:28.820
any thoughts of manipulating me.

31:30.130 --> 31:30.860
Understand?

31:35.170 --> 31:35.960
Prince.

31:50.140 --> 31:51.480
There's nothing to see here,

31:51.480 --> 31:52.200
let's go.

31:55.280 --> 31:56.240
Your Highness.

32:09.460 --> 32:10.890
Your Highness Prince Cheng,

32:10.890 --> 32:12.000
I, the Duke of Zhong,

32:12.000 --> 32:13.960
am the foremost noble in the capital.

32:13.960 --> 32:16.610
Your maternal family and mine
have been close for generations.

32:16.610 --> 32:18.360
We rise and fall together.

32:18.850 --> 32:20.810
Why cause such embarrassment?

32:21.130 --> 32:23.200
Who's rising and falling with you?

32:24.060 --> 32:25.190
The Duke's mansion today

32:25.190 --> 32:26.910
could enjoy wealth and glory

32:27.510 --> 32:29.130
all because of what my mother and I

32:29.130 --> 32:30.990
have earned for you in the palace.

32:31.330 --> 32:33.000
I am now His Majesty's

32:33.020 --> 32:34.590
only son of age.

32:35.810 --> 32:37.960
Being appointed as Crown Prince

32:37.990 --> 32:39.640
is only a matter of time.

32:41.650 --> 32:42.960
But this Ms. Feng

32:46.480 --> 32:48.880
has none of the dignity
of a future empress.

32:52.200 --> 32:53.000
Duke,

32:54.370 --> 32:56.680
if you still want future prosperity,

32:57.650 --> 32:59.910
then quietly accept this divorce decree

33:00.410 --> 33:02.410
and send your daughter to a nunnery.

33:02.510 --> 33:04.350
If you insist on making trouble,

33:04.370 --> 33:06.700
it wouldn't be difficult for my household

33:07.200 --> 33:09.520
to have a woman die of illness.

33:13.360 --> 33:15.290
Yan Qi, you bastard!

33:23.290 --> 33:24.250
Father.

33:24.570 --> 33:26.840
Go to the palace and ask the Noble Consort
to help us!

33:26.840 --> 33:27.760
Silence!

33:28.200 --> 33:30.200
Haven't we been humiliated enough?

33:35.650 --> 33:36.440
Daughter,

33:36.930 --> 33:38.930
the Noble Consort does care for you,

33:39.280 --> 33:41.480
but she is Prince Cheng's mother first.

33:41.890 --> 33:43.520
Who do you think she'll side with?

33:43.520 --> 33:46.520
So Mother will just let me be divorced
by Prince Cheng?

33:47.000 --> 33:48.940
It's your own fault for not being fertile.

33:48.940 --> 33:50.590
If you had gotten pregnant earlier,

33:50.590 --> 33:53.090
that little tramp wouldn't have
gained the advantage,

33:53.090 --> 33:54.750
causing such embarrassment.

33:54.930 --> 33:58.130
Getting pregnant isn't something
I can just make happen.

33:58.850 --> 34:01.510
The Noble Consort may be favoured
in the palace,

34:01.610 --> 34:03.440
but she only has Yan Qi, doesn't she?

34:03.440 --> 34:05.570
You know nothing about palace affairs.

34:05.570 --> 34:06.500
All these years,

34:06.550 --> 34:09.370
His Majesty has been
giving the Noble Consort beauty pills,

34:09.370 --> 34:11.300
supposedly to preserve her youth.

34:12.210 --> 34:14.770
The Noble Consort has indeed
maintained her beauty,

34:14.770 --> 34:17.210
but consuming too many medicinal compounds

34:17.210 --> 34:19.639
has made it impossible for her
to bear more children.

34:19.639 --> 34:23.570
Why would His Majesty prevent Her Highness
from having more children?

34:24.989 --> 34:26.389
You only need to remember

34:27.000 --> 34:29.800
that royal favour has always been
as thin as paper.

34:30.330 --> 34:32.510
Preserving your own wealth and status

34:33.250 --> 34:34.560
is what matters most.

34:38.489 --> 34:40.600
[Morgue]

34:52.179 --> 34:54.110
Prince Yan Che's limbs were bound,

34:54.530 --> 34:56.159
yet no blood stains were formed.

34:56.159 --> 34:58.490
It suggests that he was bound after death.

34:59.530 --> 35:02.330
There are multiple bruises
on his chest and limbs.

35:02.520 --> 35:03.890
The wound on his neck

35:03.890 --> 35:05.290
is the only fatal injury.

35:29.440 --> 35:30.770
When someone commits suicide
by slitting their throat,

35:30.770 --> 35:32.370
they would experience pain, fear,

35:32.370 --> 35:34.930
and even suffocation
when cutting the throat.

35:34.930 --> 35:37.000
So, their hand strength would weaken

35:37.730 --> 35:40.460
and the wound
would gradually become shallower.

35:41.930 --> 35:44.530
But Prince Yan Che's wound is uniform
in depth.

35:44.720 --> 35:46.410
It's clear the murderer acted swiftly

35:46.410 --> 35:47.820
without any hesitation,

35:47.850 --> 35:49.810
taking away his life with a single stroke.

35:49.810 --> 35:51.890
Prince Yan Che would rather live in prison

35:51.890 --> 35:54.120
than choose such a brutal death,

35:55.400 --> 35:57.400
especially with such a small knife.

36:02.160 --> 36:03.360
What do you plan to do?

36:04.850 --> 36:05.890
Go with the flow.

36:06.530 --> 36:08.060
Follow His Majesty's will.

36:15.720 --> 36:17.760
I have an urgent matter to report.

36:20.930 --> 36:22.540
Minister Li, please speak.

36:22.730 --> 36:25.370
Prince Yan Che's death is a matter
of state importance

36:25.370 --> 36:27.250
and cannot be settled with such haste

36:27.250 --> 36:28.960
based solely on Prince Cheng's testimony.

36:28.960 --> 36:30.480
I humbly request Your Majesty

36:30.480 --> 36:31.410
to have this case

36:31.640 --> 36:33.540
thoroughly investigated
by the Court of Judicial Review.

36:33.540 --> 36:35.400
Li Muyun, what do you mean by this?

36:35.960 --> 36:38.410
There were dozens of soldiers present
at the scene,

36:38.410 --> 36:40.340
what do you mean by "my testimony"?

36:41.080 --> 36:41.880
Your Majesty,

36:42.000 --> 36:43.890
I am Zheng Baishi,
Prefect of the capital prefecture,

36:43.890 --> 36:46.020
and I support Minister Li's proposal.

36:46.210 --> 36:47.140
Zheng Baishi,

36:47.410 --> 36:49.210
are you conspiring with Li Muyun

36:49.540 --> 36:50.740
to falsely accuse me?

36:50.890 --> 36:52.810
Your Highness, you have mistaken.

36:52.810 --> 36:55.560
I merely agreed with Minister Li's
ruling according to the law.

36:55.560 --> 36:56.960
how is that conspiracy?

36:57.560 --> 36:59.960
Prince Rui requests to have an audience.

37:00.970 --> 37:03.260
I have important evidence to present.

37:12.960 --> 37:13.770
Your Majesty.

37:14.360 --> 37:16.250
According to Princess Yongci's
examination,

37:16.250 --> 37:17.600
Prince Yan Che

37:17.640 --> 37:18.970
did not commit suicide,

37:19.210 --> 37:20.640
but had his throat cut by someone else,

37:20.640 --> 37:21.910
killed with a single stroke.

37:21.910 --> 37:22.730
Nonsense!

37:23.080 --> 37:24.340
Che had clearly

37:24.690 --> 37:26.250
took his own life with a dagger.

37:26.250 --> 37:27.770
Based on the wound analysis,

37:27.770 --> 37:28.770
the murder weapon

37:28.890 --> 37:30.180
was a long sword,

37:30.410 --> 37:32.740
not the dagger presented by Prince Cheng.

37:32.960 --> 37:34.420
I have secretly compared

37:34.640 --> 37:36.250
the shape of the Prince Yan Che's wound

37:36.250 --> 37:38.730
with the blade of Prince Cheng's sword,

37:38.730 --> 37:40.160
and they match perfectly.

37:40.160 --> 37:41.120
Absurd!

37:41.120 --> 37:41.960
Utter nonsense!

37:41.960 --> 37:42.560
Father,

37:42.590 --> 37:44.050
he's falsely accusing me!

37:50.720 --> 37:51.550
I...

37:53.340 --> 37:56.190
I ordered you to find Prince Yan Che.

37:56.920 --> 37:57.750
Why did you

37:58.730 --> 38:01.580
bind your brother's limbs

38:02.000 --> 38:02.960
and slit

38:03.440 --> 38:05.120
his throat?

38:05.120 --> 38:05.980
Father...

38:09.410 --> 38:10.210
Because...

38:11.690 --> 38:12.520
Because he...

38:12.940 --> 38:14.960
Because he refused to return with me,

38:14.960 --> 38:16.650
so I ordered him to be bound.

38:16.720 --> 38:17.870
Driven by his anger,

38:17.890 --> 38:19.450
he collided with my sword.

38:19.480 --> 38:20.960
Lies!

38:23.930 --> 38:24.730
Your Majesty!

38:25.080 --> 38:26.160
Prince Yan Che

38:27.040 --> 38:28.480
have died unjustly!

38:30.440 --> 38:31.240
Your Majesty!

38:31.690 --> 38:32.420
Prince Cheng

38:32.620 --> 38:35.440
has long harbored ambitions
to replace the Crown Prince.

38:35.440 --> 38:38.130
He relies on being Your Majesty's
only adult son

38:38.370 --> 38:40.840
and already considers the throne
his for the taking.

38:40.840 --> 38:42.050
He even declared arrogantly

38:42.050 --> 38:44.600
that Ms. Feng is unworthy to be empress,

38:44.630 --> 38:47.440
insisting on divorcing his wife
from my Duke of Zhongguo Residence.

38:47.440 --> 38:49.200
The evidence of Prince Cheng's fratricide
is conclusive.

38:49.200 --> 38:51.500
Your Majesty must not be lenient anymore!

38:51.500 --> 38:52.470
Your Majesty!

38:55.210 --> 38:56.000
Prince...

38:57.160 --> 38:58.770
Prince Cheng, Yan Qi.

38:59.250 --> 39:00.180
You are truly

39:00.850 --> 39:02.210
cruel by nature.

39:02.950 --> 39:04.750
For plotting to seize the crown,

39:04.810 --> 39:06.540
you murdered your own brother.

39:06.940 --> 39:08.400
Court of Judicial Review,

39:08.410 --> 39:09.930
detain and interrogate him!

39:09.930 --> 39:10.690
Your Majesty is wise.

39:10.690 --> 39:11.890
Your Majesty is wise.

39:13.040 --> 39:14.440
I'd like to see who dares.

39:14.440 --> 39:15.120
Who dares.

39:17.250 --> 39:18.160
All of you.

39:18.950 --> 39:20.280
Every single one of you.

39:26.890 --> 39:27.620
No.

39:34.900 --> 39:36.460
So it was you, Father.

39:37.620 --> 39:39.620
You've been deceiving me all along.

39:41.410 --> 39:44.340
You were the one
who ordered me to kill Prince Yan Che.

39:44.600 --> 39:46.160
Now you blame me for fratricide?

39:46.160 --> 39:47.560
Blame me for fratricide?

39:48.690 --> 39:49.920
Why did you lie to me?

39:50.520 --> 39:52.290
Why did you lie to me?

39:52.640 --> 39:53.960
-Why did you lie to me?
-Protect His Majesty!

39:53.960 --> 39:54.960
Treason!

39:55.190 --> 39:56.290
From this day forward,

39:56.290 --> 39:58.120
Yan Qi is stripped of his royal status.

39:58.120 --> 40:01.250
He shall be confined to
the Imperial Clan Court for life.

40:01.640 --> 40:02.160
Go!

40:02.370 --> 40:05.250
Father, why did you deceive me?

40:05.250 --> 40:07.690
I am your only adult son!

40:07.690 --> 40:08.530
Treason!

40:08.890 --> 40:10.120
Father!

40:10.830 --> 40:11.630
Your Majesty!

40:11.810 --> 40:12.610
Your Majesty!

40:13.980 --> 40:15.460
Please calm your anger, Your Majesty.

40:15.460 --> 40:16.980
Che...

40:18.580 --> 40:22.450
My dear Che...

40:36.730 --> 40:37.400
Chi.

40:40.080 --> 40:41.770
How is His Majesty's condition?

40:41.770 --> 40:43.930
The imperial physician says
His Majesty has suffered too many shocks,

40:43.930 --> 40:44.930
he's overwhelmed

40:45.120 --> 40:46.250
and needs more rest.

40:49.250 --> 40:49.820
Chi.

40:50.290 --> 40:51.480
Why don't we ask His Majesty

40:51.480 --> 40:52.640
to let us leave the capital?

40:52.640 --> 40:54.300
I'm truly tired of this court.

40:54.410 --> 40:56.120
People get executed at the drop of a hat.

40:56.120 --> 40:57.250
It's too stressful.

40:57.600 --> 40:59.000
You can leave if you want.

40:59.770 --> 41:01.330
I still have unfinished business.

41:01.330 --> 41:02.210
What business?

41:02.240 --> 41:03.640
Why don't I know about it?

41:03.810 --> 41:05.810
I'll tell you after I've handled it.

41:06.770 --> 41:07.570
That won't do.

41:08.480 --> 41:10.560
You don't have to tell me your business.

41:10.560 --> 41:12.600
But if you don't leave, neither will I.

41:12.600 --> 41:14.430
As Prince Yi, I may lack in other areas,

41:14.430 --> 41:15.370
but I value loyalty.

41:15.370 --> 41:16.830
I truly live up to my title.

41:22.470 --> 41:23.550
Our brotherhood

41:24.370 --> 41:26.030
far exceeds blood relations.

41:26.540 --> 41:27.940
Let us in this life

41:28.330 --> 41:29.990
share our fortunes together,

41:30.140 --> 41:31.540
steadfast until the end.

41:40.290 --> 41:41.080
Yan Qi.

41:41.640 --> 41:43.570
You've committed many evil deeds.

41:44.000 --> 41:46.250
Must His Majesty spell everything out?

41:47.020 --> 41:48.980
Having me escort you

41:49.000 --> 41:50.530
is already merciful to you.

41:50.690 --> 41:52.490
Just make it easier on yourself.

41:52.640 --> 41:54.770
What are you watching for? Seize him!

42:16.720 --> 42:18.050
Greetings, Prince Rui.

42:18.640 --> 42:21.210
I would appreciate
if Steward Yuan could be accommodating.

42:21.210 --> 42:22.420
I have a few words

42:22.630 --> 42:24.900
to speak privately with commoner Yan Qi.
